'''Catcademy Anthem''' (にゃんこ学園校歌斉唱, ''Nyanko Gakuen Kouka Seishou'', '''Catcademy Chorus''') is a 5-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 13.2 Update|Version 13.2]].

==Effect==
Research Power UP (L): All Cats' recharge times are reduced by 78 frames (2.6 sec).

